-- Purpose: Controls the UI, display, and client-side interactions for the Legendary Car Shop.
-- Runs on: Client
-- Location: StarterPlayerScripts.LegendaryShopController
-- Dependencies: Players, ReplicatedStorage, SoundService, Lighting, TweenService, UserInputService
-- Public API: None
-- Networking: Invokes ShopRemotes.LegendaryShop (Client -> Server)
-- Security: Purely visual client-side checks; server remains authoritative for all transactions.
-- Performance: Uses coroutines for typewriter effect; cancels stale jobs to prevent UI corruption.

-- FIXES (v3):
--   • Premium Skip button now fires the Robux product prompt immediately — no in-game
--     confirmation UI. AttemptCraft is restructured with an executeCraft() helper so
--     premium skips PromptConfirmation entirely.
--   • Active Craft panel is no longer auto-shown by UpdateActiveCraftPanel or the
--     fast-refresh loop. Visibility is managed exclusively by ShowActiveCraftPanel(),
--     which is called: (a) on shop open if a craft is in progress, and (b) after the
--     "already crafting" NPC dialogue + 2-second hold.
--   • ExitButton on the Active Craft panel now hides the panel and returns the player
--     to the main shop menu cleanly (no full shop close).
--   • closeShopUI explicitly hides the Active Craft panel so it starts hidden on
--     every fresh shop open.
--   • "garage" replaced with "Inventory" in all NPC dialogue strings.

